HEADQUARTERS - AS65001
Devices: x1 Router(R1), x2 Multi-Layer Switches(LSW1, LSW2), x2 Access-Layer Swtiches(LSW1, LSW2),
x2 Servers (Server1, Server2), x2 Wireless Access Points (WAP1, WAP2), x5 PCs (PC1-PC5), x1 Laptop (LTP1)

VLANs: Engineering-VLAN10, Marketing-VLAN20, Sales-VLAN30, 
Admin-VLAN40, Finance-VLAN50, Guest-VLAN60

IP Addressing
R1 - Carrier: 10.0.100.0/30
R1 Loopback: 1.1.1.1/32
LSW1 Loopback: 1.1.1.2/32
LSW2 Loopback: 1.1.1.3/32
R1 - LSW1: 10.0.1.0/30
R1 - LSW2: 10.0.3.0/30
LSW1 - LSW2: 10.0.2.0/30
LSW1 - DHCP_SVR1: 10.0.4.0/30
LSW2 - DHCP_SVR2: 10.0.5.0/30
VLAN10: 172.16.10.0/24
VLAN20: 172.16.20.0/24
VLAN30: 172.16.30.0/24
VLAN40: 172.16.40.0/24
VLAN50: 172.16.50.0/24
VLAN60: 172.16.60.0/24

Router (R1)

en
conf t
hostname R1
username jstone priv 15 secret admin
service password-encryption
enable secret admin
lldp run
line vty 0 4
transport input ssh
login local
ex
line console 0 
login local
ex

int se0/1/0
description HQ-CARRIER
ip address 10.0.100.2 255.255.255.252
no shutdown
int g0/0/0
description R1-LSW2
ip address 10.0.3.1 255.255.255.252
no shutdown
int g0/0/1
description R1-LSW1
ip address 10.0.1.1 255.255.255.0
no shutdown
int loopback 0
description R1_LOOPBACK
ip address 1.1.1.1 255.255.255.255
no shutdown
ex

ip route 10.0.0.0 255.255.0.0 null0 254
ip route 172.16.0.0 255.255.0.0 null0 254

router ospf 1
router-id 1.1.1.2
network 10.0.0.0 0.0.255.255 area 0
network 172.16.0.0 0.0.255.255 area 0
exit
router bgp 65001
bgp router-id 1.1.1.1
neighbor 10.0.100.1 remote-as 65000
neighbor 10.0.100.1 activate
network 10.0.0.0 mask 255.255.0.0
network 172.16.0.0 mask 255.255.0.0
end
write

Multi-Layer Switch (LSW1)

en
conf t
hostname LSW1
username jstone priv 15 secret admin
service password-encryption
enable secret admin
lldp run
line vty 0 4
