standby 3 priority 110
standby 3 preempt
int vlan 40
ip address 172.16.40.2 255.255.255.0
ip helper-address 10.0.4.2
standby 4 ip 172.16.40.1
standby 4 priority 100
standby 4 preempt
int vlan 50
ip address 172.16.50.2 255.255.255.0
ip helper-address 10.0.4.1 
standby 5 ip 172.16.50.1
standby 5 priority 100
standby 5 preempt
int vlan 60
ip address 172.16.60.2 255.255.255.0
ip helper-address 10.0.4.2
standby 6 ip 172.16.60.1
standby 6 priority 100
standby 6 preempt
int loopback 0
description LOOPBACK
ip address 1.1.1.2 255.255.255.255
int g1/0/2
description LSW1-LSW4
switchport trunk encapsulation dot1q
switchport mode trunk
switchport trunk allowed vlan 10,20,30,40,50,60
int g1/0/3
description LSW1-LSW3
switchport trunk encapsulation dot1q
switchport mode trunk
switchport trunk allowed vlan 10,20,30,40,50,60
